# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. Production's drive path before the fence: the
# starvation drive's NotDriven verdict is taken as the evidence, and the drive
# unregisters the consumer from every key without a fresh read and without a
# fence. A purge-cleared leaf re-created between the drive and the removal loses
# the block pin its birth seeded, and its un-checkpointed write is trimmed.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedDriveRemovesOnProbe
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the drive removes on its NotDriven verdict, with no fresh read and no fence
PERTURBS: Read, Decide

--- FIND
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = IF phase = "husk" THEN "husk" ELSE "live"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the drive keeps the verdict it started on.
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = IF phase = "husk" \/ p = Drive THEN "husk" ELSE "live"]
--- END

--- FIND
                    /\ k \notin touched[p]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the drive's removal is not fenced.
                    /\ (k \notin touched[p] \/ p = Drive)
--- END
